					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761260201,
					"content": "Ah... Jahoda? What brings you here? Hmm... Is Boss Nefer available right now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260202,
					"content": "(Just as I thought, he wants to see Boss Nef... Hmm, I should be able to handle a small matter like this myself.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260203,
					"content": "No need to go to all that trouble. I'm actually here because my boss sent me to help you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260204,
					"content": "Huh? Wh—What do you mean? Does that mean Boss Nefer has...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260205,
					"content": "You've always wanted to visit the Frostmoon Scions, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260206,
					"content": "So, the plan is to befriend Lyylikki first, then ask her to take you to the Frostmoon Scions?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260207,
					"content": "What!? Lady Nefer knew it all along? But I've kept it locked in my heart and barely told anyone...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260208,
					"content": "(Now is the time to use that super cool line that Boss said! What was that line again...? Um... Oh!)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260209,
					"content": "Hehe, Mr. Zompaynco, when you guard a secret, you must also learn to hide the fact that you're guarding one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260210,
					"content": "Otherwise, no matter how tall a wall you build in your heart, sooner or later the wind will find its cracks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260211,
					"content": "*Sigh* I was never good at keeping my feelings bottled up, even back when I was still in my hometown.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260212,
					"content": "(YES! I said it! All that practice paid off, heheh!)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260213,
					"content": "Well, now that you know, could you help me make an introduction? I'm an outsider, and I don't want to intrude on Miss Lyylikki.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260214,
					"content": "Don't worry, Lyylikki's really kind. Whether you're a complete stranger or in a form not entirely human, she's always warm and welcoming.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260215,
					"content": "Oh? Is that so...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260216,
					"content": "But still, calling on her unannounced is rather impolite... Um, but if you happen to know her...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260217,
					"content": "Of course I do! They should be just about done handing out the meals now. Let's head over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260218,
					"content": "Oh! And by the way, Boss also said we won't be charging you this time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761260219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 761260219,
					"content": "Oh, thank you so much! I'll go get my things right away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zompaynco"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}